WEBVTT

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.100
<i>If I can recall, it was 35 years ago.</i>

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:12.810
<i>The new continent Magmell appeared</i>
<i>and attracted colorful folks</i>

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.520
<i>ready to explore the land with big dreams.</i>

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:20.280
<i>Infamous pirates who've traveled</i>
<i>all over the Seven Seas,</i>

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.860
<i>hunters who own the rugged forests</i>
<i>and mountains as their backyard,</i>

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.240
<i>foodies who'll sacrifice relationships</i>
<i>with beautiful women for food,</i>

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:30.990
<i>and even manga editors</i>
<i>with a panty fetish!</i>

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.330
<i>But as you can imagine,</i>

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:37.880
<i>exploring Magmell was a dangerous feat.</i>

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.800
<i>Many lives were lost.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:45.340
<i>I was disgusted by those</i>
<i>folks who thought,</i>

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:50.260
<i>"While there is life, there is hope!"</i>
<i>What idiots.</i>

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:55.810
<i>And another idiot was</i>
<i>about to lose his life...</i>

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:01.400
<i>And well... that would be me.</i>

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:03.610
<i>So how did this happen again?</i>

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:06.860
What is it? Something's coming!

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:10.330
It sounds like something really big!

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:14.450
It's really big!

00:01:14.830 --> 00:01:16.790
It's extremely big!

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.960
My neck! That did not sound good!

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.730
Are you kidding me right now?

00:01:38.350 --> 00:01:39.770
It's gonna eat me!

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:42.770
It's totally gonna eat me!

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:47.650
Plus it's really hungry right now!

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.790
I can't die here. I can't die here!
There's no way I'd go like this!

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:07.130
Damn it! I can't get out at all!

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.150
I just wet myself.

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:24.110
<i>Oh well, what the heck.</i>

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:27.280
<i>I give up now. It'll be fine, right?</i>

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:32.780
<i>I tried my best, wet my pants...</i>

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:38.620
<i>That's it. I'm a goner.</i>

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.540
Time for my life to flash in front of me!

00:04:14.930 --> 00:04:20.430
DENDEN OYAJI AND MAGMELL

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:27.690
Come on in! Welcome!

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:33.360
Come on in! Welcome!

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:44.540
"Explorers who struck it rich in Magmell."

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:51.840
<i>That's ridiculous!</i>
<i>They're making a killing in Magmell!</i>

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.170
Hey there!

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:55.800
Hey Uncle Den-Den, it's me.

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:56.890
<i>Who the heck?</i>

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:59.890
Great to see ya. Oh yeah,
this is my daughter.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.770
<i>There's no way you have a daughter.</i>

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:06.020
What is it? Please don't look at me
with those lewd eyes.

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:10.980
<i>Whenever I see this guy, Inyo,</i>

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:13.650
<i>my heart nearly stops.</i>

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:18.530
New selections!
You're always fully stocked here.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:20.740
Sir-- Daddy!

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.910
It's a rare sea pig! It's expensive!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:27.120
Zero, if you want to try it,
I'll buy it for you.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.500
Daddy! Are we splurging today?

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:34.010
No, we only do that three times a year.

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:38.220
The owner here is a good friend,
so he'll give us a generous discount.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.760
Daddy, you're amazing!

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:43.640
Oh, stop it! You're embarrassing me!

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:45.230
<i>"Good friend"?</i>

00:05:46.060 --> 00:05:48.140
<i>I'm the one who loses profits every time!</i>

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.150
<i>Ever since we met for the first time...</i>

00:05:55.190 --> 00:05:57.030
How much is this hand grenade?

00:05:57.320 --> 00:06:00.660
Thank you. That'll be 4,100 esc, sir.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:02.620
So, here's 1,000.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:05.750
So, here's 1,000 esc.

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.960
<i>What do you mean, "so"?</i>
<i>I'm not selling it to you!</i>

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.170
Or was 800 esc okay?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.750
<i>Not even 1,000?</i>

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:17.670
That's not... Please don't play me, sir.

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:21.220
But these hand grenades are expired.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:23.100
Expired?

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:24.060
<i>They're not potatoes!</i>

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:28.060
See? They look like they're
about to explode without activating it.

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:29.140
What?

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:39.950
<i>Since then, I've made many trips</i>
<i>to the eye doctor.</i>

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.820
<i>Rumors spread and customers stayed away.</i>

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:45.910
<i>That's not all...</i>

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.290
Ta-da!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.170
<i>Fake bills? Handwritten?</i>

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:54.290
Whoa, that almost hit me!

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.840
Shoot! I stepped on poop!

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.300
<i>It's not even funny.</i>

00:07:00.090 --> 00:07:01.970
My fly's open.

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:03.600
<i>You're blaming me for it?</i>

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:08.220
<i>He's gotten away with so many discounts.</i>

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:10.940
<i>But not today.</i>

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:13.150
<i>My shelves are reinforced.</i>

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.270
<i>Double-checked all the dangerous goods.</i>

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:17.030
<i>My floors are clean.</i>

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:19.990
<i>And that's not all.</i>

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:22.410
This is a bit complicated.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:25.410
I'll buy it in bulk.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:29.500
<i>But he sure does pick out</i>
<i>the dangerous stuff.</i>

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.330
<i>Is he a hardcore military item collector?</i>

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:36.210
Uncle Den-Den, I'm ready to check out.

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:39.010
Let's see...

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.600
That's 60,000 esc.

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:50.480
<i>This is the moment!</i>

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.100
<i>No, there's no need to feel nervous.</i>

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.980
<i>I'm fully prepared.</i>

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:58.570
<i>I've installed micro,</i>
<i>high-speed-lens night vision</i>

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:00.360
<i>and even infrared cameras</i>
<i>all over the store.</i>

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:04.360
<i>Every corner is fully covered.</i>

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:07.410
<i>Forty years of being a working adult,</i>

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:10.250
<i>I've invested all my secret savings</i>
<i>for this!</i>

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:14.210
<i>You're doomed. No matter</i>
<i>what trick you try on me!</i>

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:15.420
I'll pay by card.

00:08:16.670 --> 00:08:17.500
Excuse me?

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:22.760
I forgot all about it,
but today's splurging day.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:24.800
So there's no need for a discount.

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:28.470
Don't worry about the discount.

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:30.850
You've been very generous to me.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.850
What?

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.860
Can you get it delivered to my house?
See you again soon.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:43.360
<i>Was I being too overly suspicious?</i>

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:46.780
<i>I guess I was mistaken...</i>

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.080
<i>Wait a minute!</i>

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.790
No!

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:09.890
DEN-DEN'S HARDWARE STORE

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:18.270
My daughter!

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:21.650
Daddy...

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:23.820
Don't die, my daughter!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.990
I won't say goodbye...

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:27.860
I'm sure we'll meet again...

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:29.660
Wait... Hey...

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.830
Please live a happy life...

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.330
Daughter! Don't die!

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.880
I'm... I'm sorry.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:44.380
What should we do?
Should we call an ambulance?

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:45.300
You!

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:52.140
Don't you understand?

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:57.480
Give me that damn discount!

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:58.940
What?

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:06.440
Here, you get a 90-percent discount.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.570
See you again soon, Uncle Den-Den!

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.200
<i>Please don't tell me...</i>

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.380
<i>What?</i>

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:27.050
<i>I was played again!</i>

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:31.640
<i>I lost! I surrender to his pettiness.</i>

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:34.970
<i>I can't take this anymore!</i>

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.730
That's right!

00:10:38.640 --> 00:10:42.230
I'll go to Magmell! I'll start
a new life in Magmell!

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:46.990
I just realized I'd rather die
in Magmell than face that bastard again!

00:10:47.570 --> 00:10:53.410
That's right! I'll go to Magmell
and make a killing too!

00:11:07.170 --> 00:11:09.170
CLOSED

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:18.810
It's a brand-new day.

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:21.640
This baby's gotta come
with me on this journey.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:24.270
I'm feeling young again.

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.900
<i>But will I make it there with this?</i>

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:30.320
Well, let's see what happens.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:31.820
Come on, buddy!

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:34.030
Are you closed today?

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:38.290
Sir, why are you aboard?

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:40.040
Because you had open seats.

00:11:40.120 --> 00:11:41.580
Are you an alpinist?

00:11:41.660 --> 00:11:44.790
We came all this way. Give us a ride home.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:46.790
Yeah.

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:50.630
Okay.

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:52.010
Thanks!

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:55.680
Sir-- Daddy, are we putting
on that act again today?

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:56.890
Later.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.180
<i>Cut it out!</i>

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:12.450
Daddy, what a nice view.

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:16.200
Yes daughter, today's
a perfect day for a drive, isn't it?

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:20.450
<i>I don't have time for</i>
<i>a leisurely drive, damn it!</i>

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:24.420
Sir, are you sure this
is the right direction?

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.830
Oh, yeah. Just keep going straight.

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:30.210
And can't this thing go any faster?

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.720
Come on Daddy, what can you expect?

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:38.470
Of course his ride's
going to be dingy too.

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:40.770
I see.

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:43.230
The ride suits its driver.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:45.440
Well, there's nothing
we could do about that.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.560
Sir...

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:51.070
With a belly like that,
there's no way. Right, Daddy?

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:54.070
Yes daughter, there's no way.

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:57.910
<i>Just watch. Try not to freak out</i>
<i>and wet yourself!</i>

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.790
Sir, back in the day,

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:08.290
people used to call me,
Thunderbolt Den-Den.

00:13:11.130 --> 00:13:14.760
I used to ride around here all the time.

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:18.680
Those days are long gone.

00:13:18.760 --> 00:13:20.350
So you can't anymore, right?

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:22.520
Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:13:25.060 --> 00:13:27.650
Let's go! Yeah!

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:38.490
What do you think of that?

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:41.660
Thunderbolt Den-Den is back in action!

00:13:43.750 --> 00:13:44.660
Wait, what?

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:55.630
What, no way!
Why aren't the brakes working?

00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:03.140
I'm gonna die! I'm gonna die!
I'm gonna die!

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:13.940
No!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:30.500
Dumbass! You're gonna die!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.250
I survived!

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:39.260
Are you serious?

00:14:47.350 --> 00:14:49.520
Save me! Help!

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:55.020
Lucky me, there's a float here.

00:14:58.150 --> 00:15:02.030
Now that I think about it, there's no way
I'd make it to Magmell with my bike.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.410
The ocean... The ocean's calling my name.

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.920
<i>I splurged!</i>

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:23.340
<i>I used up all of my savings</i>
<i>and financed a 30-year loan.</i>

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:27.600
<i>Not to worry, that's nothing compared</i>
<i>to what I'll make in Magmell.</i>

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:29.810
<i>This is my boat.</i>

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:33.860
<i>No matter how dangerous,</i>
<i>I'll cross this ocean to get to Magmell!</i>

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:36.610
<i>Don't I look really cool right now?</i>

00:15:37.110 --> 00:15:38.940
A boat!

00:15:39.030 --> 00:15:40.360
Daddy, we're on a boat!

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:42.610
-We sure are, daughter.
<i>-Why the heck are you guys here?</i>

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:44.410
Going somewhere?

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:46.830
I'm about to go on a journey.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.290
<i>I'm not telling you guys!</i>

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:52.420
Daddy, he's packed a lot of food here.

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:55.790
He's packed a bunch
of weapons too, daughter.

00:15:56.340 --> 00:15:59.170
It's not just a journey, is it?

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:01.010
<i>Don't go through my stuff!</i>

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:05.600
Daddy, it's as if he's a criminal
scheming an escape.

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:06.640
Don't judge me!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:11.060
You guys purchased weapons all the time.

00:16:11.140 --> 00:16:13.730
You have no right to call me a criminal.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:16.560
Let me show you something.

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:22.950
What about that magic trick?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.490
It's not magic. It's Lacht.

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:26.620
Lacht?

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:29.700
Sir-- Daddy is a Lachter.

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:31.290
Lachter?

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:34.170
A pineapple head like you
won't understand.

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:39.500
Those with the ability to analyze
a structure and manipulate matter.

00:16:40.380 --> 00:16:41.590
They're called Lachters.

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:46.220
I analyzed the hand grenade
I purchased at your store the other day.

00:16:46.510 --> 00:16:49.600
I needed to understand its construction
in order to use Lacht.

00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:52.810
So it's very inconvenient for me
when your store is closed.

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:57.900
If you tell another soul about Lacht,

00:16:57.980 --> 00:16:59.650
I'll stop your heart.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:00.570
What?

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.440
Here's a goodbye gift.

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:05.320
Thank you very much.

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:08.910
It won't last until Magmell though.

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:13.370
-Run!
-Run!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.170
You should throw it out now!

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.120
Oh, yeah!

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:31.760
My precious boat!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:34.480
My awesome precious boat!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:37.100
My 30-year loan!

00:17:40.520 --> 00:17:43.190
<i>That's right, I've still got the sky.</i>

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.360
<i>A man's final frontier,</i>

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:47.450
<i>the deep blue sky!</i>

00:17:47.780 --> 00:17:49.530
Daddy, he's a stubborn one.

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:51.620
Agreed, daughter.

00:17:59.040 --> 00:18:00.710
<i>There's no turning back now.</i>

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:04.920
<i>I've lost my bike, my boat,</i>
<i>and all my money.</i>

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:08.220
<i>But that's not gonna stop me!</i>

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:11.970
<i>But will this really make it to Magmell?</i>

00:18:12.350 --> 00:18:15.310
<i>I've gotta do it!</i>
<i>I'm gonna make a killing!</i>

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:18.810
<i>This is a man's moment!</i>

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:25.320
<i>All right! They're nowhere in sight.</i>
<i>I'm good to go.</i>

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.240
Let's go!

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:38.830
<i>I'm flying! I'm flying through</i>
<i>the wide-open sky right now!</i>

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.630
<i>Goodbye, my shop, my youthful days!</i>

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:44.380
<i>Now I'm off!</i>

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.760
To Magmell, the land of hope!

00:18:49.630 --> 00:18:51.510
<i>Wait, where is Magmell?</i>

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:55.140
<i>I can check on my map app.</i>

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:56.770
<i>Where's my smartphone?</i>

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.270
<i>My hands aren't free!</i>

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:01.560
<i>What do I do now?</i>
<i>What do I do, what do I do!</i>

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:04.070
<i>This is really bad, isn't it?</i>

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:07.820
Hey! You make a right in about 200 meters.

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.610
A right? Perfect. I'm good now.

00:19:11.410 --> 00:19:12.240
Wait, what?

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:13.910
You're flying, I see.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:15.120
You too!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:18.330
You're not quite settled in that updraft.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.460
I'll help you out.

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:21.670
What? No, please!

00:19:21.750 --> 00:19:24.340
I don't know what you're
trying to do, but please stop.

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.340
Make a right at the intersection.

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:37.850
A bit overkill, huh?

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:39.430
<i>I think so.</i>

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:45.270
A car!

00:19:58.660 --> 00:20:00.330
Ouch!

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:02.370
What? What is it?

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.500
What's happening?

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:05.670
Stop, stop!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.460
Please stop! Stop I say!

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:10.550
Even if it's for work,

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:14.720
I'm excited to see Magmell
for the first time.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:17.720
Don't let them eat you
instead of the pigs, buddy.

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:21.180
Hey, don't scare me like that, sir.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:27.310
No! Save me now!

00:20:36.240 --> 00:20:37.490
<i>Flashback complete.</i>

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:43.790
<i>I see. You've been waiting</i>
<i>this entire time, huh?</i>

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:45.790
<i>You're pretty nice, after all.</i>

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:49.590
I take that back! You're not nice at all!

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:50.670
Stop! Don't eat me! Help!

00:20:50.920 --> 00:20:55.380
<i>Damn it! I should've just</i>
<i>stuck with the hardware store!</i>

00:20:55.470 --> 00:20:57.300
<i>Magmell is scary!</i>

00:20:57.390 --> 00:21:00.180
<i>Goodbye, mother! Goodbye, my friends!</i>

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.190
What?

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:16.700
Sir...

00:21:18.620 --> 00:21:19.450
My friend!

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.880
Welcome to Magmell.

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:35.380
Sir, let's go shopping again soon.

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:36.340
Yeah.

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:12.480
PREVIEW

00:23:12.560 --> 00:23:15.360
<i>Why are cats just the cutest?</i>

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:17.570
<i>If I had a cat at home,</i>

00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:21.860
<i>would it greet me every time I get home?</i>

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:25.660
<i>Will it snuggle up on my lap</i>
<i>like a dinner roll?</i>

00:23:25.740 --> 00:23:29.790
<i>Will it beg for food when it's hungry?</i>

00:23:29.870 --> 00:23:32.080
<i>Oh, I'm fantasizing!</i>

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:35.840
<i>Sir! I've made my decision.</i>
<i>I'm gonna get a cat!</i>

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:36.750
<i>Denied.</i>

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:40.670
<i>Next time, "Eye of SHUIN." Don't miss it.</i>

00:23:40.760 --> 00:23:41.880
Subtitle translation by Sachiko Takahashi
